<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1964</h1><p class="ref-lede">1964 in world history: 30 events, 4 births, 16 deaths, 4 works, 6 states founded and 7 that came to an end. 310 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
